    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "在家里，他看到了李汉。他很高兴地说：“爸爸，爸爸！小米和我在一起了！”",
      "traditional": "在家裡，他看到了李漢。他很高興地說：“爸爸，爸爸！小米和我在一起了！”",
      "pinyin": "zài jiā lǐ tā kàn dào le lǐ hàn tā hěn gāo xìng de shuō bà ba bà ba xiǎo mǐ hé wǒ zài yì qǐ le",
      "english": "At home, he looked at Li Han. He said very happily, “Dad, Dad! Little Mi and I are together!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "李汉笑了笑，说：“是吗？”",
      "traditional": "李漢笑了笑，說：“是嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "lǐ hàn xiào le xiào shuō shì ma",
      "english": "Li Han smiled and said, “Really?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“是的！是的！”李飞坐在李汉旁边，说：“我们一起坐出租车去电影院。",
      "traditional": "“是的！是的！”李飛坐在李漢旁邊，說：“我們一起坐出租車去電影院。",
      "pinyin": "shì de shì de lǐ fēi zuò zài lǐ hàn páng biān shuō wǒ men yì qǐ zuò chū zū chē qù diàn yǐng yuàn",
      "english": "“Yes! Really!” Li Fei sat beside Li Han and said, “We took a taxi to go to the movie theater together."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "后来，出租车停下来了，停了两个小时。你知道出租车为什么停下来吗？”",
      "traditional": "後來，出租車停下來了，停了兩個小時。你知道出租車為什麼停下來嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái chū zū chē tíng xià lai le tíng le liǎng ge xiǎo shí nǐ zhī dào chū zū chē wèi shén me tíng xià lai ma",
      "english": "Afterwards, the taxi stopped. It stopped for 2 hours. Do you know why the taxi stopped?”"
    },
    {
